    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d313">

                <pb facs="0416" n="244" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg244"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/3697a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Diplomatic Representatives
                        in All Countries except Russia </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Circular telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-06">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 6, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>On April 6 Congress declared and President proclaimed that a state of war exists
                    between the United States and the Imperial <pb facs="0417" n="245"
                        xml:id="pg245"/> German Government. So inform the government to which you
                    are accredited.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
